name: DAMON (Data Access MONitor)
source: Linux 5.15 / 5.16
description: Lightweight data access monitoring framework. DAMON_RECLAIM for proactive page reclaim, DAMON_LRU_SORT for LRU list optimization. Works well with MGLRU.
config: CONFIG_DAMON=y, CONFIG_DAMON_RECLAIM=y, CONFIG_DAMON_LRU_SORT=y
status: experimental
baseline: 4.19
